{
  "experiment": "E1 step 1: three-zone premium output on frozen V28 score; no weights fitted",
  "protocol": "Zone = slight if |score|<lo, borderline if lo<=|score|<hi, meaningful if |score|>=hi. Section A uses the band [0.9,1.5) chosen by inspection in the review (in-sample, optimistic). Section C selects (lo,hi) on the training rows of the 25 saved v35 family folds (premium-winning-gap-validation-v35.json), maximising outside-band accuracy subject to a band-share cap, then scores validation rows; V28 margins are in-sample for 620 of 655 rows, so C is conditional calibration, as in the project protocol. Section D applies the fixed band to V28 nested-CV held-out margins (620 rows) under v28 and v35 labels. Direction outputs are unchanged by construction.",
